01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The Last Kiss is a 2006 American romantic comedy-drama film which is based on
2001 Italian film of the same name, directed by Gabriele Muccino.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
The plot revolves around a young couple and their friends struggling
with adulthood and issues of relationships and commitment.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
The film stars Zach Braff, Jacinda Barrett, Casey Affleck and Rachel Bilson.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
The screenplay was written by Paul Haggis, and directed by Tony Goldwyn.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
Much of The Last Kiss was filmed in and around Madison, Wisconsin.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
As with Garden State, Braff was involved with the film's soundtrack.

18
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
The first teaser trailer was released on Braff's
official website in mid-June 2006.

19
01:35:00,000 --> 01:35:06,000
The film premiered at the Deauville Film Festival and the Toronto International Film Festival on September 10,
2006, and was released by DreamWorks Pictures (through Paramount Pictures) on September 15, 2006.

20
01:40:00,000 --> 01:40:06,000
The film received mixed reviews, and grossed $16
million against a $20 million budget.

21
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:06,000
The film explores themes of pregnancy, striptease,
architect, deceived wife, stripper.

22
01:50:00,000 --> 01:50:06,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
